<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>The Order of the Lion's Bell</title>

<style>

:root{
--bg:#060606;
--gold:#d6b36a;
--softGold:#8c6b32;
--ink:#f4efe6;
--muted:#cfc6b2;
--violet:#6e66ff;
--panel:rgba(18,14,26,0.75);
}

*{box-sizing:border-box}

body{
margin:0;
font-family:Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
background:
radial-gradient(circle at 50% 10%, rgba(110,102,255,0.18), transparent 25%),
radial-gradient(circle at 20% 10%, rgba(214,179,106,0.12), transparent 20%),
linear-gradient(#020202,#07050d 45%,#030303);
color:var(--ink);
overflow-x:hidden;
}

/* stars */
body::before{
content:"";
position:fixed;
inset:0;
pointer-events:none;
background-image:
radial-gradient(circle at 10% 15%,white 0 1px,transparent 2px),
radial-gradient(circle at 25% 40%,#d6b36a 0 1px,transparent 2px),
radial-gradient(circle at 80% 25%,white 0 1px,transparent 2px),
radial-gradient(circle at 70% 70%,white 0 1px,transparent 2px),
radial-gradient(circle at 45% 60%,#d6b36a 0 1px,transparent 2px);
opacity:.7;
}

.page{
width:min(1100px,92%);
margin:auto;
position:relative;
z-index:1;
}

nav{
display:flex;
justify-content:space-between;
align-items:center;
padding:1.2rem 0;
border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,230,180,.15);
}

.brand{
letter-spacing:.18em;
text-transform:uppercase;
}

.brand small{
color:var(--muted);
font-size:.65rem;
display:block;
}

.brand strong{
font-size:.9rem;
}

nav a{
text-decoration:none;
color:var(--ink);
margin-left:1.2rem;
font-size:.7rem;
letter-spacing:.14em;
text-transform:uppercase;
}

nav a:hover{color:var(--gold)}

/* HERO */
.hero{
text-align:center;
padding:5rem 0 3rem;
}

.hero-card{
background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(20,15,30,.6),rgba(8,8,12,.3));
border:1px solid rgba(255,235,200,.15);
border-radius:28px;
padding:3rem 1.5rem;
backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
box-shadow:0 0 45px rgba(110,102,255,.18);
}

.symbol-line{
color:var(--gold);
letter-spacing:.6rem;
margin-bottom:1rem;
font-size:.9rem;
}

h1{
margin:.3rem 0;
font-size:clamp(3rem,8vw,6rem);
text-transform:uppercase;
letter-spacing:.05em;
text-shadow:0 0 16px rgba(110,102,255,.4);
}

.subtitle{
max-width:700px;
margin:1.4rem auto;
line-height:1.8;
color:var(--muted);
}

.cta{
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
gap:1rem;
flex-wrap:wrap;
margin-top:1.5rem;
}

.btn{
padding:.9rem 1.2rem;
border-radius:999px;
font-size:.75rem;
letter-spacing:.15em;
text-transform:uppercase;
text-decoration:none;
color:var(--ink);
border:1px solid rgba(214,179,106,.35);
}

.btn.primary{
background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(214,179,106,.2),rgba(110,102,255,.1));
}

.btn:hover{color:var(--gold)}

/* sections */
section{margin-top:4rem}

.section-title{
text-align:center;
margin-bottom:2rem;
}

.section-title h2{
text-transform:uppercase;
letter-spacing:.08em;
}

.section-title p{
max-width:650px;
margin:auto;
color:var(--muted);
}

.grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
gap:1rem;
}

.card{
background:var(--panel);
border:1px solid rgba(255,235,200,.12);
border-radius:22px;
padding:1.4rem;
position:relative;
}

.card::after{
content:"";
position:absolute;
inset:10px;
border:1px solid rgba(214,179,106,.08);
border-radius:14px;
pointer-events:none;
}

.card h3{
margin:.5rem 0;
text-transform:uppercase;
font-size:1rem;
letter-spacing:.08em;
}

.card p{
color:var(--muted);
line-height:1.7;
font-size:.95rem;
}

.glyph{
font-size:1.5rem;
color:var(--gold);
}

/* manifesto */
.manifesto{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;
gap:1rem;
}

.panel{
background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(16,13,22,.9),rgba(7,7,10,.85));
border:1px solid rgba(255,235,200,.12);
border-radius:26px;
padding:1.5rem;
}

.quote{
font-size:clamp(1.2rem,2.5vw,2rem);
line-height:1.5;
}

.quote strong{color:var(--gold)}

.ritual{
text-align:center;
}

.ritual .symbol{
font-size:4rem;
margin:1rem 0;
color:var(--gold);
text-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(110,102,255,.4);
}

footer{
margin-top:4rem;
padding:1.5rem 0;
border-top:1px solid rgba(255,235,200,.15);
text-align:center;
font-size:.7rem;
letter-spacing:.12em;
color:var(--muted);
text-transform:uppercase;
}

@media(max-width:900px){
.grid,.manifesto{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="page">

<nav>
<div class="brand">
<small>Borderline Sciences Research Observatory</small>
<strong>The Order of the Lion's Bell</strong>
</div>

<div>
<a href="#doctrine">Doctrine</a>
<a href="#archive">Archive</a>
<a href="#watch">Skywatch</a>
<a href="#initiate">Initiate</a>
</div>
</nav>

<section class="hero">

<div class="hero-card">

<div class="symbol-line">♌ ✦ ☾ ✦ 🛸 ✦ ⟁ ✦ 🔔</div>

<h1>
The Order<br>
of the Lion's Bell
</h1>

<p class="subtitle">
A secret knightly observatory devoted to the study of celestial intelligence, gnostic cosmology, and unidentified craft. Within Lion's Bell, ancient symbols of kings and temples stand beside star charts and encounter reports. The pyramids, the heavens, and the hidden watchers are studied as one mystery.
</p>

<div class="cta">
<a class="btn primary" href="#initiate">Seek Initiation</a>
<a class="btn" href="#archive">Enter Archive</a>
</div>

</div>

</section>

<section id="doctrine">

<div class="section-title">
<h2>The Gnostic Doctrine</h2>
<p>
Lion's Bell teaches that the universe is layered with hidden intelligences. Ancient civilizations glimpsed them through temples and pyramids; modern witnesses glimpse them through silent craft in the sky.
</p>
</div>

<div class="grid">

<div class="card">
<div class="glyph">♌</div>
<h3>Knights of the Bell</h3>
<p>
Members of the order serve as sworn observers — guardians of forbidden sightings, ancient cosmology, and signals that drift through the heavens.
</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="glyph">🛸</div>
<h3>Sky Visitors</h3>
<p>
Reports of silent craft, geometric lights, and impossible aerial motion are preserved as sacred evidence of a higher cosmic intelligence.
</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="glyph">⟁</div>
<h3>Pyramid Knowledge</h3>
<p>
Ancient pyramids may have been observatories, temples, or signaling devices built to communicate with celestial watchers.
</p>
</div>

</div>

</section>

<section id="archive">

<div class="section-title">
<h2>The Hidden Archive</h2>
<p>
Within the sealed library of Lion's Bell are preserved encounter logs, gnostic diagrams, star maps, and temple schematics collected under oath.
</p>
</div>

<div class="manifesto">

<div class="panel">

<p class="quote">
"Between the <strong>lion</strong> and the <strong>stars</strong> lies a forgotten kingdom of knowledge where myth, temple geometry, and celestial craft converge."
</p>

</div>

<div class="panel ritual" id="watch">

<h3>Current Skywatch Rite</h3>

<div class="symbol">🛸</div>

<p>
At moonrise the Bell is struck three times. Knights observe the sky in silence, awaiting the return of the watchers.
</p>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<section id="initiate">

<div class="section-title">
<h2>Initiation</h2>
<p>
Only those who demonstrate discipline, secrecy, and openness to the cosmic mystery may be admitted to Lion's Bell.
</p>
</div>

<div class="grid">

<div class="card">
<div class="glyph">I</div>
<h3>The Witness</h3>
<p>
Submit a sighting, dream, or anomaly worthy of the archive.
</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="glyph">II</div>
<h3>The Oath</h3>
<p>
Swear to guard the knowledge of Lion's Bell and never reveal its rites.
</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="glyph">III</div>
<h3>The Summons</h3>
<p>
Those accepted will receive a sign through dream, signal, or correspondence.
</p>
</div>

</div>

</section>

<footer>
The Order of the Lion's Bell · Borderline Sciences Research Observatory · Beyond the Visible Sky
</footer>

</div>

</body>
</html>
